        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Designed with a patented internal support system, the trtl Pillow helps prevent head drop and neck strain during travel by gently supporting your neck in a natural position. Unlike bulky memory foam pillows, its ergonomic wrap-style design fits snugly around your neck, allowing you to rest comfortably even in upright seats. Crafted from soft, skin-friendly fleece, the pillow feels cozy against your skin while remaining breathable for long journeys. Weighing just 4.5 oz, it’s easy to carry and attaches effortlessly to backpacks or luggage using the included travel bag. When it’s time to freshen up, simply remove the internal support and toss the fabric wrap into the washing machine—quick-drying and ready for your next trip. Whether you’re flying overnight, commuting by train, or heading out on a road trip, the trtl Pillow helps you arrive feeling rested, refreshed, and pain-free.</p>",
